{"id": "train-05-001", "text": "Nothing on this phone will go online anymore. My grandson was here Sunday fiddling with it and now none of the apps work.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-002", "text": "I flew out to see my daughter and now that I'm home the phone still won't get on the internet at all. There's a little airplane picture at the top.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-003", "text": "Facebook just says no connection. Email says no connection. Everything says no connection. What did I do", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-004", "text": "The weather app wont update and the news one is blank. It all worked fine yesterday morning.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-005", "text": "How do I get the phone back online? I think I pushed something when I swiped down from the top of the screen.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-006", "text": "YouTube keeps telling me I'm offline but I'm sitting right here in my kitchen same as always.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-007", "text": "A message popped up about saving data, I pressed yes, and now WhatsApp and the internet page won't load a thing.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-008", "text": "Can't look anything up on Google, can't get my email, nothing. I turned off the mobile data because my son said it would save battery, maybe thats it?", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-009", "text": "I'm out at the park and the phone wont go on the internet. Those little bars that are usually up top are gone.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-010", "text": "Very frustrating. The bank app says check your connection and I need to move money for my rent today.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-011", "text": "The phone shows it is connected to my home internet, the name and everything, but nothing will open. Google just spins and spins.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-012", "text": "It says Connected right under my wifi name but YouTube won't play a single video.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-013", "text": "Full bars on the wireless at the top, yet my email won't come in and pages wont load. What gives?", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-014", "text": "I'm at my daughter's house, she put me on her network and it shows the check mark, but nothing loads. Her phone works fine.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-015", "text": "The little fan symbol is all filled in so I know I'm hooked up, but Facebook just shows a gray empty screen.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-016", "text": "Why would the phone say connected when no website comes up? I've tried three times now.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-017", "text": "At the library the phone joined their free wifi and says connected but Google Maps won't find anything.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-018", "text": "How do I fix it when the internet sign is full but nothing actually works? Very anoying.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-019", "text": "Connected to the router, it says so plain as day, but my weather app says no internet. Make up your mind phone!", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-020", "text": "After the power went out last night the phone went back on my home network and shows it's conected but no pages open.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-021", "text": "My sister says she called me three times and I never heard a thing. The phone was right next to me on the table.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-022", "text": "I keep finding missed calls from the doctors office but the phone never rings. It just sits there quiet.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-023", "text": "Phone doesnt make any noise when people call. It just buzzes a little in my purse and I miss everything.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-024", "text": "My son called on WhatsApp and I didn't hear a peep. Later there was a note saying I missed it.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-025", "text": "How do I make my phone ring out loud again? I think I turned it to silent at church on Sunday.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-026", "text": "There's a little moon picture at the top and since then nobody's calls ring. Is that the Do Not Disturb thing?", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-027", "text": "I turned the sound all the way down during a movie and now when people call it's dead quiet. I'm worried I'll miss the hospital.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-028", "text": "Missed my grandaughter's call again. The screen lights up but there's no ring at all.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-029", "text": "The phone is stuck on vibrate and I cant figure out how to get the ringing back.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-030", "text": "Nobody can reach me! I only find out they called hours later. It used to ring nice and loud.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-031", "text": "My WhatsApp messages don't show up until I open the app. Then there's ten of them all at once.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-032", "text": "My daughter texted me at noon and I didn't see it until supper. The phone never made a sound or showed anything.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-033", "text": "Emails arrive hours late. By the time I see them it's too late to answer.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-034", "text": "The little banners at the top that tell you about new messages stopped coming. Did I turn them off by mistake?", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-035", "text": "Facebook used to ding when someone wrote to me. Now nothing until I go look.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-036", "text": "How do I get the phone to tell me when a message comes in? It just sits there quiet.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-037", "text": "After the phone did an update last week my text mesages come in silently and I miss them.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-038", "text": "My pharmacy app is supposed to remind me about my pills and it doesn't pop up anymore. That worries me.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-039", "text": "I only find out I have messages when I happen to open WhatsApp. My church group thinks I'm ignoring them.", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-040", "text": "Notifications are not coming through at all. Is something blocked?", "labels": ["notifications_missing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-041", "text": "The phone has started talking to me! It reads out everything I touch and I can't make it stop.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-042", "text": "There's a green box around whatever I press and nothing opens unless I tap twice. What happened?", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-043", "text": "My granddaughter was playing with my phone and now a lady's voice says every word on the screen.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-044", "text": "I can't scroll down anymore with one finger. The phone talks and puts a square around things.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-045", "text": "How do I turn off the voice that reads everything out loud? It's driving me crazy.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-046", "text": "Pressed both volume buttons by accident and now the phone speaks every button I touch.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-047", "text": "Cant open my email. One tap just makes it say \"Gmail\" and draw a box. I have to tap two times.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-048", "text": "Something called TalkBack came on and I don't know how to get rid of it.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-049", "text": "The phone keeps announcing the time, the battery, everything I put my finger on. Its very loud and I'm embarassed.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-050", "text": "I'm trying to answer a call and it just reads the buttons to me instead of letting me press them. Please help.", "labels": ["talkback_on"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-051", "text": "Everything on my screen turned gray, like an old TV. Pictures of my grandkids have no color at all.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-052", "text": "The screen looks like a photo negative. White is black and black is white. I didn't touch anything!", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-053", "text": "My phone went black and white all of a sudden. Is it broken?", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-054", "text": "Colors are all wrong, faces look blue and strange in my photos and on YouTube.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-055", "text": "How do I get the colors back on my screen? Everything is shades of grey.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-056", "text": "After I was poking around trying to make the letters bigger something changed and now the colors are flipped backward.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-057", "text": "The whole screen has a sickly greenish look to it, morning noon and night. It wasn't like this last week.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-058", "text": "I think I turned on color inversion by mistake. How do I undo it?", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-059", "text": "My WhatsApp pictures look like X-rays now. Dark where it should be light.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-060", "text": "Everythings gone colorless on this phone. Its depressing to look at.", "labels": ["colours_wrong"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-061", "text": "My screen is so dark I can barely make out anything. I have the lamp on and still cant read it.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-062", "text": "When I'm out in the garden I can't see the phone at all. Just my own reflection.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-063", "text": "The screen keeps getting darker on its own while I'm using it. Then I can hardly see.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-064", "text": "How do I make the screen brighter? Its awful dim.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-065", "text": "I slide the little sun bar all the way to the right and it still won't get any lighter.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-066", "text": "Trying to read Google Maps in the car for my husband and the screen is too dark in the sunshine.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-067", "text": "Ever since the battery got low yesterday the screen has stayed dim, even after charging it all night.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-068", "text": "The brightness seems stuck way down. I'm 78 and my eyes aren't what they were.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-069", "text": "My phone screen looks like it's in shadow all the time. Very hard on my eyes.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-070", "text": "Can barely see the numbers to dial. Screen is dull and dark, worse then my old phone.", "labels": ["screen_too_dim"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-071", "text": "I'm reading a recipe and the screen goes black every few seconds. My hands are covered in flour!", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-072", "text": "The phone locks itself so fast I can't finish reading my email.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-073", "text": "How can I make the screen stay on longer? It shuts off before I'm done reading.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-074", "text": "Reading the church bulletin on Facebook and the screen keeps going dark on me.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-075", "text": "Every time I look away for a second the screen is black and I have to put my code in again. So annoying.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-076", "text": "I read the news on my phone and it keeps turning off in the middle of an article.", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
{"id": "train-05-077", "text": "The screen timeout must be too short. Can you make it longer?", "labels": ["screen_turns_off_fast"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-05", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "american", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "some"}}
